2026-10-01T16:39:14.1716851Z # PASS the kit covers the fifteen building kinds roadmap section G names
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1717219Z # PASS every kind builds sound geometry at all three LODs
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1717796Z # PASS every kind, at every frontage and storey count it offers, lands inside the section 4 budget
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1718386Z # PASS curved surfaces are smooth shaded, and flat ones are not
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1718767Z # PASS a pitched roof is laid in courses, not drawn as one grey sheet
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1719140Z # PASS a window is a hole in the wall, not a pane buried behind one
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1719513Z # PASS a back addition is behind the house, not in its front garden
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1719877Z # PASS the map LOD is the same building seen small, not a different one
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1720285Z # PASS every district assembles a populated block inside the scene budget
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1720744Z # PASS the budgets hold at every tile size the API accepts, not only the default one
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1721225Z # PASS a block is assembled from shared building meshes, not from unique buildings
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1721657Z # PASS lots tile the block without overlapping each other or leaving the tile
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1722046Z # PASS the card and the map lay the same town out as the close view does
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1722403Z # PASS what is drawn stays on its own lot and out of its neighbour
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1722882Z # PASS a baked variant reports the footprint it drew, not the one it was asked for
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1723341Z # PASS the same block id builds the same town, in this process and in a fresh load
2026-10-01T16:39:14.1723724Z # PASS a second node process builds the same town, byte for byte
